  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Any Craft or Profession 10 ranks, Artificery.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using the skill chosen with the Artificery feat to create a magic item, you may craft that magic item whether or not you possess its prerequisite base sphere. Crafting a magic item in this fashion increases the skill check required to make the item by +5.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
